ket Admission process steps</a></li><li><a href="/companies/nasdep" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">NASDeP Admission steps</a></li><li><a href="/companies/n-dsp" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">N-DSP Admission process</a></li><li><a href="/companies/faqs" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">FAQs (Companies)</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Investors</h3><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li><a href="/investors/get-started" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">How to Invest / Get Started</a></li><li><a href="/investors/brokers" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Find a Broker</a></li><li><a href="/investors/fees" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Fees &amp; Trading Hours</a></li><li><a href="/investors/faqs" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">FAQs (Investors)</a></li></ul></div></div><!-- Column 4: Products + Resources --><div class="space-y-8"><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Products</h3><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li><a href="/products/otc" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">NASD OTC Exchange</a></li><li><a href="/products/private-market" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">Private Market</a></li><li><a href="/products/nasdep" class="text-xs text-neutral-600 hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:underline">NASDeP</a></l